<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9500"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 1:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks OzDude - I read that and totally didn&#39;t put it together. Appreciate you pointing it out.  <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t think I&#39;m ready to change professions, though. Just writing in the blog about this stuff gets inside you and makes you feel gross sometimes. Being a profiler would not be good for one as prone to the blues as yours truly.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
