<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12207"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve...don&#39;t be afraid of your &#34;gift&#34; like you said...&#34;try to reproduce that in the future&#34;  Going back over your postings makes MY hair stand on end<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR>So...trust your gut...seems to me you have been given a gift...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
