<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12222"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 1:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve...also, as I have learned - don&#39;t work tooo hard on retracing your mental steps...just let it happen... <BR>just don&#39;t blow it off or ignore it tho when it does... <BR>follow your gut. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
